<span id="A1.F6.pic1.2.30" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F6.pic1.2.30.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">After generating the relevant (s, r, o) triplets, check each triplet individually and generate all possible o values for the given s and r. If a tuple (s, r, o) contains multiple outputs for the same s and r, delete that tuple. If o is an attribute rather than an object, also delete that tuple.</span></span>
<span id="A1.F6.pic1.2.31" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F6.pic1.2.31.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Answer Related Knowledge Triples:</span></span>
