<span id="A1.F10.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please analyze whether a given response to a VQA question matches its corresponding answer. If they match, output ”Yes”; otherwise, output ”No”. Only output the judgment result ”Yes” or ”No”. We will provide relevant image information to assist in the judgment.</span></span>
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Image: The given image.</span></span>
